      "Spread 1/4 of the meat mixture thinly and evenly over the dough, pressing it firmly into the crust with your fingers all the way to the edges.",
      "Carefully transfer the flatbread onto the preheated stone using a pizza peel or parchment paper.",
      "Bake for 5-6 minutes until the crust is blistered and golden-brown, and the meat is sizzling.",
